1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,970
The consequences came as a difference between two medical opinions.

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:12,273
A republican deputy and a red cross doctor stood on the beach and watched the helicopter bring a patient out of the valley.

3
00:00:12,273 --> 00:00:16,538
“The illness is not the flood,” the doctor said.

4
00:00:16,538 --> 00:00:24,857
“It is the water we drink after it.” A rapid flash of lightning lit the jungle behind them.

5
00:00:24,857 --> 00:00:34,410
The health data of the district had a bias that nobody had written down: the people who filled in the forms were the ones who could breathe easily.

6
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:38,890
“My hospital sees the same set,” she said.

7
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:51,018
“The simple things, the low things, the things someone never reports.” A steak and a jar of oil on the table were the whole of a good week.

8
00:00:51,018 --> 00:00:56,922
The outdoor workers had cholesterol and thunder in their ears and nothing else.

9
00:00:56,922 --> 00:01:09,045
“You can transplant a kidney but not a river,” the doctor said, and the transplantation of the old dam was, in her view, an inferior solution.

10
00:01:09,045 --> 00:01:22,053
A ski slope on a volcanic hillside, a staircase of concrete, and a magnetic scan of the soil: the project had produced better evidence than the ministry.

11
00:01:22,053 --> 00:01:29,857
The earthquake of the previous year had buried a family under a stair, and nobody in the ministry had quaked.

12
00:01:29,857 --> 00:01:39,441
“Sunshine and a favourable wind are not a strategy,” the deputy said, and his words went forth into the record.

13
00:01:39,441 --> 00:01:51,869
The lively part of the meeting was the quarrel about the silicon in the river: a paw of mud, a plow in the field, a stocking full of samples, and a vapour of doubt.

14
00:01:51,869 --> 00:01:59,698
“You can bathe in this water,” he said, “but you cannot shave in it and call it clean.”

15
00:01:59,698 --> 00:02:12,371
The energetic minority won one point: a home-monitoring scheme with a transplant check, a set of readings within the same week, and a re-measurement after each flood.

16
00:02:12,371 --> 00:02:18,780
The environment, the doctor said, is not a game between two parties.

17
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:28,063
A favorable wind, a biblical flood, and a continent of mud: nothing would hinder the plan more than a short breath.

18
00:02:28,063 --> 00:02:35,847
The price of a transplant was advantageous, and the eagle could soar above it all.
